.TH ckman-piv-objects 1  ckman 
.SH NAME
ckman\-piv\-objects \- Read and write arbitrary PIV data objects
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBckman\-piv\-objects\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Read and write arbitrary PIV data objects
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
ckman\-piv\-objects\-export(1)
Read an arbitrary PIV object
.TP
ckman\-piv\-objects\-import(1)
Write an arbitrary PIV object value (without the outer 53 container)
.TP
ckman\-piv\-objects\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
